~ start
if not States.has_met_Hiro:
	set States.has_met_Hiro = true

	Guard: Sorry, Hiro. Can't let you through.
	Hiro: Why can't I pass?
	Guard: Outside this gate is very dangerous.a
else:
	% Guard: Go home, Hiro!
	% Guard: You're still here, Hiro?
	% Guard: I told you, you can't pass!
	% Guard: David is [wave]GAY[/wave]
	=> END

=> choices
~ choices

- When will your shift be over?
	Guard: Until the mountain bell rings.
	Hiro: The mountain bell?
	Guard: The old bell that watches over the mountain pass.
	=> END

- I want to go out.
	Guard: You can't. No one who passes this gate returns alive.
	Guard: Better go home
	=> choices